      "reason": "Replaces the 3X-then-10X-above-Rs-20,000 model with the issuer structure. Restates the four source exclusions (fuel, EMI, cash withdrawal, fees and charges). 1X rules (utility, insurance, railway MCC 4112, FASTag MCC 4784) have lower priority numbers than 10X travel so they win. International and birthday 10X are info (not expressible in Phase 1). The in-app hotel/flight bonus rules are not in the Wealth source and are not added (booking-channel dependent; see research note).",
      "source_url": "https://www.idfcfirst.bank.in/content/idfcfirstbank/en/credit-card/wealth.html",
